{"speciesId":327,"names":{"fr":"Spinda","es":"Spinda","en":"Spinda","ja":"パッチール"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"All the SPINDA that exist in the world are said to have utterly unique spot patterns. The shaky, tottering steps of this POKéMON give it the appearance of dancing."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"No two SPINDA are said to have identical spot patterns on their hides. This POKéMON moves in a curious manner as if it is stumbling in dizziness. Its lurching movements can cause the opponent to become confused."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is distinguished by a pattern of spots that is always different. Its unsteady, tottering walk has the effect of fouling its foe’s aim."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"No two SPINDA are said to have identical patterns. It confuses foes with its stumbling motions."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"No two SPINDA are said to have identical patterns. It confuses foes with its stumbling motions."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"No two SPINDA have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"No two SPINDA have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"No two SPINDA have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The chances of two SPINDA having identical spot patterns is less than one in four billion."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The chances of two SPINDA having identical spot patterns is less than one in four billion."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Les motifs sur leur fourrure sont propres à chaque Spinda. Son pas chancelant le rend difficile à viser."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les motifs sur leur fourrure sont propres à chaque Spinda. Son pas chancelant le rend difficile à viser."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les motifs sur leur fourrure sont propres à chaque Spinda. Son pas chancelant le rend difficile à viser."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"No hay dos Spinda que tengan idénticos pelajes. Su tambaleo al bailar confunde a los rivales."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"同じ ブチ模様の パッチールは いない。フラフラした 足取りで 相手の ねらいを 外す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"La chance que deux Spinda avec les mêmes motifs se rencontrent est de moins d’une pour quatre milliards."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La probabilidad de que dos Spinda con dibujos idénticos en su pelaje se encuentren es casi inexistente."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The chances of two Spinda having identical spot patterns is less than one in four billion."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"同じ ブチ模様の パッチールが 偶然に 出会う 確率は ４０億分の１ 以下だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On raconte que chaque Spinda dispose d’un agencement de taches tout à fait unique. La démarche chancelante et titubante de ce Pokémon donne l’impression qu’il danse."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dicen que no hay dos Spinda que tengan los mismos dibujos en el pelaje. Este Pokémon tiene una forma de andar inestable, va tambaleándose. Da la sensación de ir bailando."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"All the Spinda that exist in the world are said to have utterly unique spot patterns. The shaky, tottering steps of this Pokémon give it the appearance of dancing."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"世の中に いる パッチールは みんな 違う ところに ブチ模様が あると いわれている。 おぼつかない 歩みが 踊りのように 見える。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On dit que chaque Spinda dispose d’un agencement de taches unique. Ce Pokémon se déplace bizarrement, comme s’il titubait. Ses mouvements hésitants décontenancent ses ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"No hay dos Spinda con los mismos dibujos en el pelaje. Este Pokémon se mueve de forma muy curiosa. Da la impresión de estar mareado. Se tambalea y puede llegar a causar confusión a su enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"No two Spinda are said to have identical spot patterns on their hides. This Pokémon moves in a curious manner as if it is stumbling in dizziness. Its lurching movements can cause the opponent to become confused."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"同じ ブチ模様は ないと いわれている。 いつも 目を 回している ような フラフラした 動きには 敵を 惑わせる 効果が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Bien qu’il semble peu assuré sur ses pattes, Spinda est quant à lui persuadé d’avancer tout droit, faisant fi de ses embardées."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Aunque Spinda pretende avanzar en línea recta, no puede evitar andar tambaleándose."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its steps are staggering and unsteady, but Spinda thinks it’s walking in a straight line."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"フラフラ おぼつかない 足取りだが パッチール自体は 真っ直ぐに 歩いている つもりだよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Chaque Spinda possède un pelage unique. Chercher les différences d’un Spinda à l’autre serait même un passe-temps pour certains."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Cada Spinda tiene dibujos diferentes en su pelaje. Dicen que algunos estudiosos disfrutan analizando los distintos patrones."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Each and every Spinda has a slightly different configuration of spots. There are collectors who enjoy the tiny differences in their spot patterns."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ブチ模様は １匹１匹 違う。 僅かなブチの 位置の 違いを 楽しむ マニアも いるという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il déambule d’un pas chancelant. S’il marche trop longtemps, il finit par avoir le tournis."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Se mueve tambaleándose de un lado para otro y termina mareado si camina durante un largo período."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its steps are shaky and stumbling. Walking for a long time makes it feel sick."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"フラフラ おぼつかない 足取り。 長い 間 歩き続けると 気分が 悪くなってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Chaque Spinda possède un pelage unique. Ce Pokémon esquive les attaques de son adversaire grâce à d’imprévisibles oscillations."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Los dibujos en el pelaje de cada Spinda son diferentes. Esquiva de forma asombrosa los ataques de los rivales gracias a sus tambaleos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Each Spinda’s spot pattern is different. With its stumbling movements, it evades opponents’ attacks brilliantly!"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"１匹ずつ ブチ模様は 異なる。 フラフラした 動きで 相手の 攻撃を 絶妙に かわすぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":327,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"headbutt